I'll update the component to initialize the user filter to the current user and ensure it shows all recent chats across all projects when a user filter is active.

## Changes Required

| Change | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| Initialize `selectedUserId` | Set to current user ID on component mount |
| Update filter logic | Remove project filtering when user filter is active, show chats across all projects |
| Activate filter by default | Show that user filter is active from the start |

