I'll update the component to keep search and filter options always visible in full mode. Here are the changes needed:

## Changes Summary

| Section | Change | Reason |
|---------|--------|--------|
| Template Structure | Move search/filter controls outside the conditional rendering | Always visible regardless of mode |
| Header Layout | Create fixed header with controls | Persistent UI elements |
| Content Area | Adjust scroll container | Accommodate fixed header |
| Styling | Add proper spacing and borders | Maintain visual hierarchy |

